{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25248","headline":"再赴襄阳辱宣武相公贻诗今用奉酬 · 李逢吉","name":"再赴襄阳辱宣武相公贻诗今用奉酬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"解韍辞丹禁，扬旌去赤墀。\n自惊非素望，何力及清时。\n又据三公席，多慙四老祠。\n岘山风已远，棠树事难追。\n江汉饶春色，荆蛮足梦思。\n唯怜吐凤句，相示凿龙期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李逢吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}